    "body": "Any comments here? I'm inclined to just rename the property to `interestfor=IDREF` to match `commandfor`.\n\nThe CSSWG just [resolved](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9236#issuecomment-2940736593) to call the CSS properties `interest-delay-*` so I think `interestfor` as an attribute aligns nicely.\n\n@annevk @nt1m @smaug---- @emilio @keithamus any objections?",
